  "ingredients": [
    "1 (20 ounce) can crushed pineapple with juice",
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "3 tablespoons cornstarch",
    "1 tablespoon lemon juice",
    "1 (14.1 ounce) package double-crust pie pastry, thawed",
    "2 tablespoons milk",
    "1 tablespoon white sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VqIv8BcuiVZczL2wqVLrmniH2FY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15903-pineapple-pie-VAT-step-01-5f776ce4c47c4a33b916eb9a0be0a59b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15903/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the filling: Combine crushed pineapple with juice, sugar, cornstarch, and lemon juice in a medium saucepan. Cook and stir over medium heat until thickened, then boil for 1 minute. Allow filling to cool slightly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RwLMRlasY59O4_T8jiix0hoQhcU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15903-pineapple-pie-VAT-step-02-f713df8cb5d14986a0f50b7de72eb0ad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15903/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line a 9-inch pie dish with one of the crusts. Pour filling into the prepared pie dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PA_bZ9wb0RD9zvD863UZFIZ12JY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15903-pineapple-pie-VAT-step-03-75a96381898a43feb66d0caaa1679143.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15903/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover with remaining crust; press and flute the edges to seal. Cut a few steam vents on top, brush with milk, and sprinkle with sugar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RCJzlTNLmYkrfPzwsAT3sR-o-2o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15903-pineapple-pie-VAT-step-04-03cf0760594a4d9aa698581436cd14be.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15903/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until pie is golden brown and pineapple filling is bubbling, about 35 minutes. Serve chilled or at room temperature.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oHXK3v3KmvUw7V29KW4XJHDi1LQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15903-pineapple-pie-VAT-step-05-a5e0bb5edcfd40e18604b51554691c52.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15903/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
